"Chainers get a small brownish-red ledger on day one for their wordchain students."
"It opens bottom-to-top; page one bears both signatures in dark green brush ink."
"Its grid records each chain's name, casting date and finishing date."
"It is an honesty pledge, not a contract, and a copy goes to the Palace of Unbreaking."
"Frequent debt-avoiders lose the right to refuse that Chainer's family bestowing chains."
"Negligent Chainers are reprimanded and lose student privileges."
